Package: PTPM
Type: Package
Title: Paired Transcriptomic Perturbation Modeling
Version: 0.1.5
Authors@R: person("Francesco", "Russo", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "francesco.russo@cnr.it")
Description: Protocol for estimating the predictability of a paired
    transcriptomic perturbation phenotype from baseline profiles. It combines
    patient-grouped nested cross-validation, fold-internal feature selection,
    fold-internal adjustment for mathematical coupling between baseline
    predictors and the paired outcome, a 2 x 2 decomposition of the
    performance gap, patient-level bootstrap confidence intervals, and
    sensitivity analyses on pathway scoring (training-reference GSVA,
    ssGSEA), coupling and pathway circularity.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
